# A Vault controlled by the other player also stores two counters and produces exactly two black mana (CR 603.4, 605.1a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Island x25
[Bot2 Deck]
Bottomless Vault
Island x25
[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Bottomless Vault.Play
Bot2.Decline
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Counters.Storage = 1
Bot2.Decline
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Counters.Storage = 2
Bot2.Accept
[T8 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Activate(X: 2)
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Mana = {B}{B}
[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Counters.Storage = (absent)
